  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add the diced onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the refried beans, diced tomatoes, diced pickle, salt, pepper, and oregano to the skillet.",
    "Stir well to combine all the ingredients.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer for 10 minutes.",
    "Stir in the lemon juice.",
    "Serve the skillet hot, garnished with chopped fresh parsley if desired."
